# GitHub Is the Default Remote

- Treat **GitHub** (`https://github.com/shourya0523/pharma-analog-uptake-workbench.git`) as the canonical remote for this repo.
- The local remote named `origin` points at GitHub. Use `origin` for fetch, push, PRs, and branch tracking.
- Cursor Cloud uses the `cursor` remote (`https://origin.cursor.com/...`). Only use it when explicitly syncing with a cloud agent branch.
- Default branch operations: `git fetch origin`, `git push origin`, `gh` against GitHub.
- Do not recreate pipeline-generated gold writers (`build_gold_web_search.py`, `audit_fill_gold.py`, etc.). Gold lives in `seed/gold/` and is rebuilt only with `scripts/build_independent_gold.py`.
